{"content_kind":"narrative.field","definition":{"id":"malet_deal","index_mapping_version":1,"metadata":{"chapter":2,"title":"The Price","title_ko":"가격"},"rows":[{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_deal/0","jump":null,"original_index":0,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_first_sword_extraction.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":0,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":0,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The extractor was civilian-grade. Small. Clean. Almost gentle.","text_ko":"추출기는 민간용이었다. 작고. 깨끗하고. 거의 다정할 정도로."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_deal/1","jump":null,"original_index":1,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/story_ch2_lost_instructor_grip.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":1,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":1,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"The memory surfaced as it was pulled: a courtyard, dust in afternoon light, a hand larger than his closing his fingers around a wooden grip.","text_ko":"끌어당기면서 기억이 떠올랐다. 안뜰, 오후 햇살의 먼지, 나무 손잡이를 잡은 손가락보다 더 큰 손."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_deal/2","jump":null,"original_index":2,"presentation":{},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":2,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":2,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Absolute certainty that the person teaching him was the most important person in the world.","text_ko":"그를 가르치는 사람이 세상에서 가장 중요한 사람이라는 절대적인 확신."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_deal/3","jump":null,"original_index":3,"presentation":{"cg":"res://assets/cg/generated/chapter_expansion/ch02_first_sword_empty_space_v1.png"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":3,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":3,"text":{"speaker":"","text":"Then it left. Silent as a drawer closing. And where it had been, nothing. A space shaped like significance, emptied of content.","text_ko":"그리고 그것은 떠났다. 서랍이 닫히듯 조용히. 그것이 있던 자리에는, 아무것도. 의미의 형태를 한, 내용이 비워진 공간만."}},{"action":{},"choices":[],"choices_present":false,"effect_phase":"gate_then_effects","effects":{},"gate":{},"id":"field/malet_deal/4","jump":null,"original_index":4,"presentation":{"portrait":"arrel_exhausted"},"provenance":{"dialect":"field","group_position":2,"original_choice_index":-1,"original_index":4,"source_file":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","source_hash":"67ec5b7c5f455f41ba997fd6c84220f85f8f87f7f111ef9b3e28c8ead935ac21","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949"},"storage_index":4,"text":{"speaker":"Arrel","text":"...","text_ko":"..."}}]},"dialect":"field","extractor_version":"memoria-narrative/1","schema_version":1,"semantic_sha256":"d6362c3c5f5c5e1ccc65c26a0f4d5008ec7d1e58730f42d2126598b4956b2d7f","source_revision":"4f772fafb1c7c6da68f56f44d60a7c7fed7f3949","sources":[{"path":"data/chapter2_dialogue.json","sha256_utf8_lf":"67ec5b7c5f455f